Subject: Fix upstream Flechette 2.7.0 TypeScript 7 factory declaration emission
Upstream: https://github.com/uwdata/flechette/tree/6616b73cf873bd20c90f84b8428a28913546c1fd
The constructor-assigned private readonly row factory emitted as public untyped getFactory;
explicit owner field annotations restore its declaration. Generated with the owner types config.
Runtime factory logic is unchanged; strict external consumers must keep skipLibCheck false.

